  "body": "Situated in the iconic Nautilus complex this North facing 5th level apartment is your perfect live in, holiday home or investment. Located in the heart of Orewa village within steps of great shopping, full medical facilities, eateries and the beach.\r\n\r\nThe beautifully presented apartment comprises of a spacious master bedroom and the added bonus of an office which can be used as a small 2nd bedroom. There is also a tidy bathroom/laundry plus an open plan kitchen and lounge area opening to the covered balcony which overlooks the pool area, village and out to the sea.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include double glazing, new blinds, storage unit and 2 secure carparks. Owners also enjoy resort style facilities including full use of the pool, hot-tubs, sauna, outdoor areas, lobby and gym. \r\n\r\nBC fees - $7133 pa / Council Rates - $2834.47 pa\r\n\r\nOwners reside in the apartment complex. Please phone Ellie 021 619 240 to arrange appointment to view.",
